#89005
"Corner of Brembledon Avenue and Millco's Way"
"Millco's way comes to an end at this corner of the town, while to the east
Brembledon Avenue begins its eastern run along the northern part of the
village.  The grass is bright green and tall here, covering almost all of the
hilly surface of the avenue.  Also growing among the grass are patches of
clovers and several wildflowers, including dandelions and buttercups, which
dot the lush green landscape in yellow.  A pair of cottages have been erected
to the north and west.
"
