mouth is agape with a shocked expression, and its hands are raised as though
attempting to shield itself from something.  Emanating from the western
building are odorless gases of sundry colors.  The street extends to the north
and south, where the grass continues to grow abundantly and almost totally
blankets the tilted ground.
"
