shelves are several windows that allow just enough air from the outside in to
speed up the cooling process.  Set against the southern wall are two massive
ovens.  Ripples of heat can be seen in front of each of the ovens.  In the
center of the room, a long wooden table has been set up on which several pies,
each a different flavor, rest under a glass box.
"
