depictions of fearsome monsters painted across their chest area.  A large
wooden tanning and curing rack has been erected to the west, on which rests a
steaming piece of leather.  In front of the rack is a small stone desk on
which rest knives, tongs and a large bag of salt.  To the south a small
doorway leads out of the cottage.
