the northern wall.  Spades, clay pots, and other gardening equipment have been
stored on the shelves.  Resting in a neat pile at the northeast corner of the
room are several large bags of soil and fertilizer.  Beside the pile is a
watering pot that is half empty.  To the east is a small door that leads back
outside.
